{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primordial Fate</strong> is a 2D pixel-art point-and-click horror/adventure game where you control multiple characters through a fast-paced, narrative-driven story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimal inventory and straightforward puzzles, your ending depends on how thoroughly you explore. Using a simple two-click mouse system -\u00a0<strong>right-click to LOOK</strong> and <strong>left-click to INTERACT</strong> (full controls are explained in-game) - you can examine or interact with any highlighted point of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boasting three and a half unique endings, this game rewards careful exploration and attention to detail. <strong>Save often, and read everything you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrett and his sister Lilly are excited for their trip to the beautiful town of Antwostend. What they don\u2019t know is that something ancient and malevolent has been orchestrating their arrival for centuries\u2026 plotting and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they escape fate, or is their future already written in the stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting Note</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features optional AI voice acting, which can be enabled or disabled in the options menu. It was originally designed without voice acting; these voices were added post-production as an optional feature for players who want it.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Made the Mixture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/542b9ea6a28b3905cd886da6cc2947fd1ef8928b.jpg"},{"name":"Met the Guard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/b39d9bbf46c511c3c55ae4adead3cc6df794300d.jpg"},{"name":"Historian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/7ac0ef4cb01a327bbdb69f4398c16ae09963bf7a.jpg"},{"name":"Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/94512e606a23c48b24037a64b42cae91cd6c5552.jpg"},{"name":"Unprepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/b33f9036b56ead38287145e850da53f5ff9a1a1c.jpg"},{"name":"The Rat Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/5fb9e2e9700a373f42277a7dbff0e837adf8ecfd.jpg"},{"name":"Escaping Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/0450f2130dda241be6d411d427e7cb5e4dc1a216.jpg"},{"name":"Annihilation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635630/01a12263191e69f10fe0523c96f16ed9db232374.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635630?t=1751414383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635630/f0a71e97f588cc890175f541cdf039408074b5cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751414383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635630/810785b262eb7d34189c69de84ed061467986647/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751414383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635630/810785b262eb7d34189c69de84ed061467986647/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751414383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game involves the death of main character in multiple ways."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primordial Fate</strong> is a 2D pixel-art point-and-click horror/adventure game where you control multiple characters through a fast-paced, narrative-driven story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimal inventory and straightforward puzzles, your ending depends on how thoroughly you explore. Using a simple two-click mouse system -\u00a0<strong>right-click to LOOK</strong> and <strong>left-click to INTERACT</strong> (full controls are explained in-game) - you can examine or interact with any highlighted point of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boasting three and a half unique endings, this game rewards careful exploration and attention to detail. <strong>Save often, and read everything you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrett and his sister Lilly are excited for their trip to the beautiful town of Antwostend. What they don\u2019t know is that something ancient and malevolent has been orchestrating their arrival for centuries\u2026 plotting and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they escape fate, or is their future already written in the stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting Note</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features optional AI voice acting, which can be enabled or disabled in the options menu. It was originally designed without voice acting; these voices were added post-production as an optional feature for players who want it.</p>","developers":["David Blomme"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635630/46fc40119e260020489b8a22ec29b59078ad96b9/header.jpg?t=1751414383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstat